# Build context for services/*/Dockerfile is the REPO ROOT (each Dockerfile
# needs the sibling services/lib/ tree), so this file keeps the context small
# and keeps host build artifacts out of every image. Each Dockerfile COPYs
# only the paths it needs, so this list is deliberately limited to things no
# image should ever contain rather than an allow-list of one service's needs.
.git
.github
.claude
**/node_modules
*.xlsx
